3
00:00:05,996 --> 00:00:09,188
Today we're diving into a service that
every driver touches daily.

4
00:00:09,538 --> 00:00:12,826
Car Leather Steering Wheel Repair at
Desert Diamond in Dubai.

5
00:00:13,175 --> 00:00:15,407
We've got a special guest who just had it
done.

6
00:00:15,757 --> 00:00:19,357
Hi, I'm Ahmed, visiting from Riyadh.

7
00:00:19,707 --> 00:00:21,675
Ahmed, thanks for joining us.

8
00:00:22,025 --> 00:00:23,201
My pleasure.

9
00:00:23,551 --> 00:00:25,807
So walk us through why you booked this
repair.

10
00:00:26,157 --> 00:00:29,709
The wheel was cracked and faded from the
desert sun.

11
00:00:30,059 --> 00:00:32,435
Makes sense, the heat here is brutal.

12
00:00:32,785 --> 00:00:38,641
Exactly. I booked online through
car-care.center, super easy.

13
00:00:38,990 --> 00:00:40,646
Did you call or just the website?

14
00:00:40,996 --> 00:00:45,604
Just the website, picked a slot, got
confirmation instantly.

15
00:00:45,954 --> 00:00:49,098
Nice. How was the studio when you arrived?

16
00:00:49,448 --> 00:00:55,880
Al Quoz Industrial Area 3, clean,
organized, European‑trained techs.

17
00:00:56,230 --> 00:00:57,406
Sounds professional.

18
00:00:57,756 --> 00:01:02,052
They greeted me, walked me through the
process step by step.

19
00:01:02,402 --> 00:01:03,698
What did they do first?

20
00:01:04,048 --> 00:01:08,344
First they inspected the leather, noted
every crack and fade.

21
00:01:08,693 --> 00:01:09,245
Then?

22
00:01:09,595 --> 00:01:13,459
They matched the exact colour using a
premium leather dye.

23
00:01:13,809 --> 00:01:15,393
Colour match is crucial.

24
00:01:15,743 --> 00:01:20,279
Absolutely. After that they cleaned the
surface thoroughly.

25
00:01:20,629 --> 00:01:21,733
Any special prep?

26
00:01:22,083 --> 00:01:25,995
They sanded lightly, applied a primer,
then the dye.

27
00:01:26,345 --> 00:01:27,569
How many layers?

28
00:01:27,919 --> 00:01:32,023
Three thin coats, each cured under a UV
lamp.

29
00:01:32,372 --> 00:01:33,668
That sounds meticulous.

30
00:01:34,018 --> 00:01:38,122
It was. They finished with a protective
sealant.

31
00:01:38,472 --> 00:01:40,152
How long did the whole thing take?

32
00:01:40,502 --> 00:01:44,102
About four hours total, maybe a bit more.

33
00:01:44,452 --> 00:01:45,604
Did you wait or leave?

34
00:01:45,954 --> 00:01:49,074
I waited in the lounge, they offered
coffee.

35
00:01:49,424 --> 00:01:50,456
Nice touch.

36
00:01:50,806 --> 00:01:55,102
When they handed me the keys, the wheel
looked brand new.

37
00:01:55,451 --> 00:01:56,555
Feel any difference?

38
00:01:56,905 --> 00:02:01,201
Smoother grip, no rough patches, colour
matches perfectly.

39
00:02:01,551 --> 00:02:03,279
Did they give aftercare advice?

40
00:02:03,629 --> 00:02:07,493
Yes, they recommended a leather
conditioner every month.

41
00:02:07,843 --> 00:02:08,635
And the price?

42
00:02:08,985 --> 00:02:14,217
It was 1500 AED, exactly as listed.

43
00:02:14,567 --> 00:02:15,287
Worth it?

44
00:02:15,637 --> 00:02:19,813
Definitely. Peace of mind driving in this
heat.

45
00:02:20,162 --> 00:02:21,002
Glad to hear that.

46
00:02:21,352 --> 00:02:23,944
Did they mention any durability
expectations?

47
00:02:24,294 --> 00:02:28,158
They said with regular conditioning it
should hold up for years.

48
00:02:28,508 --> 00:02:29,540
That's reassuring.

49
00:02:29,890 --> 00:02:31,666
Any follow‑up service offered?

50
00:02:32,016 --> 00:02:35,376
They offered a free touch‑up check after
six months.

51
00:02:35,726 --> 00:02:36,326
Nice.

52
00:02:36,676 --> 00:02:38,596
How was the communication throughout?

53
00:02:38,945 --> 00:02:43,673
They sent a reminder SMS the day before,
and a thank‑you note after.

54
00:02:44,023 --> 00:02:45,103
Professional touch.

55
00:02:45,453 --> 00:02:47,109
Would you recommend it to friends?

56
00:02:47,459 --> 00:02:52,067
Absolutely, especially for anyone dealing
with desert dust.

57
00:02:52,417 --> 00:02:52,993
Great.

58
00:02:53,343 --> 00:02:56,271
Now let's bring in our detailing expert,
Omar.

59
00:02:56,621 --> 00:02:57,509
Hey team.

60
00:02:57,859 --> 00:03:01,123
Omar, what causes swirl marks and how do
you remove them?

61
00:03:01,472 --> 00:03:08,192
Our facts list polishing as a service;
swirl marks come from improper wash

62
00:03:08,542 --> 00:03:10,342
Got it, thanks Omar.

63
00:03:10,692 --> 00:03:13,044
Next up, our Before & After rubric.

64
00:03:13,394 --> 00:03:17,498
Before: a steering wheel with cracks,
fading, and rough texture.

65
00:03:17,848 --> 00:03:21,664
After: restored colour, smooth finish,
protected leather.

66
00:03:22,014 --> 00:03:24,678
