transformation.

67
00:03:25,028 --> 00:03:27,044
Exactly, you feel it every drive.

68
00:03:27,394 --> 00:03:29,338
And the leather stays supple longer.

69
00:03:29,687 --> 00:03:33,983
Before: the leather felt stiff, colour
uneven, cracks visible.

70
00:03:34,333 --> 00:03:37,933
After: supple, uniform colour, cracks
invisible.

71
00:03:38,283 --> 00:03:40,227
You can see the difference in the
stitching too.

72
00:03:40,577 --> 00:03:42,929
And the protective layer repels dust
better.

73
00:03:43,279 --> 00:03:45,511
Small change, big daily impact.

74
00:03:45,861 --> 00:03:47,157
That wraps the main chat.

75
00:03:47,507 --> 00:03:49,883
Thanks Ahmed for sharing your experience.

76
00:03:50,233 --> 00:03:52,033
